<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 30 bln esc, 5.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 30 bln esc, 5.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 30 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market at 5.5 percent in a fixed rate repurchase tender.</p>
<p>The Bank announced it was cutting the rate 20 basis points ahead of the tender, which takes effect on Tuesday. The average rate was 5.7 percent at a variable rate repo earlier on Monday.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
